---
source: system/tests/help_snapshots.rs
expression: "help_output(\"setsid\")"
---
Run a program in a new session

Usage: setsid [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>...

Arguments:
  <COMMAND>...  Program and its arguments

Options:
  -c, --ctty     Set the controlling terminal to the current one
  -f, --fork     Always create a new process
  -w, --wait     Wait for the program to end and return its exit status
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
